  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "offset": 702,
    "length": 58,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　曹军距离新野不远，迅速组建一支部队，抵御曹军的进攻。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "offset": 760,
    "length": 46,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　利用曹仁轻敌之机，攻克樊城，击败曹仁部。"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "offset": 806,
    "length": 56,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　利用博望坡有利地形，阻击曹军，击败夏侯┲所率曹军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "offset": 862,
    "length": 34,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败来犯的曹仁军，守卫新野。"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "offset": 896,
    "length": 30,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击退曹操大军，坚守樊城。"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "offset": 926,
    "length": 56,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　部队进入襄阳城，如果无法进入襄阳，则部队撤往江陵。"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "offset": 982,
    "length": 42,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　部队继续撤往江陵，击退追击的蔡瑁军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "offset": 1024,
    "length": 34,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　坚守襄阳重镇，抵御曹军进攻。"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "offset": 1058,
    "length": 38,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　救回失散的刘禅，回到长坂桥以南。"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "offset": 1096,
    "length": 54,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　消灭进犯江夏的曹军部队，以确保与孙权的联合作战。"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "offset": 1150,
    "length": 34,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败曹操水军，摧毁曹军水寨。"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "offset": 1184,
    "length": 34,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败曹操水军，摧毁曹军水寨。"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "offset": 1218,
    "length": 36,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败曹军，抵抗曹军的连锁战船。"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "offset": 1254,
    "length": 30,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　在赤壁彻底击败曹操水军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "offset": 1284,
    "length": 32,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　截击从乌林退往南郡的曹操。"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "offset": 1316,
    "length": 40,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　歼灭曹仁军，攻克南郡城，收复荆州。"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "offset": 1356,
    "length": 48,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败昔日的盟友，孙权，完成兴复汉室的愿望。"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "offset": 1404,
    "length": 38,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　侦察刘备军实力，击败关平，周仓。"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "offset": 1442,
    "length": 36,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败关羽张飞，打开新野的大门。"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "offset": 1478,
    "length": 28,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　进攻博望，击败刘备军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "offset": 1506,
    "length": 28,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　攻克新野，歼灭刘备军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "offset": 1534,
    "length": 28,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　进攻樊城，歼灭刘备军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "offset": 1562,
    "length": 42,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　歼灭向南逃窜的刘备，以迫降荆州刘表。"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "offset": 1604,
    "length": 30,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　轻骑追赶刘备，歼灭敌军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "offset": 1634,
    "length": 54,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　攻克江陵，掌握荆州的钱粮重地，为进取江南作准备。"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "offset": 1688,
    "length": 52,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败江夏的刘备军，以保护大军进攻江南时的侧翼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "offset": 1740,
    "length": 24,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败周瑜所率水军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "offset": 1764,
    "length": 32,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败孙权水军摧毁敌军水寨。"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "offset": 1796,
    "length": 28,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　用连锁战船击败孙权军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "offset": 1824,
    "length": 48,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　击败周瑜，黄盖水军，防御从陆上来的刘备军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "offset": 1872,
    "length": 26,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　逃出乌林，撤往南郡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "offset": 1898,
    "length": 36,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　守住南郡城，阻止刘备继续北上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "offset": 1934,
    "length": 24,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　彻底歼灭周瑜水军。"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "offset": 1958,
    "length": 44,
    "kind": "level-briefing",
    "text": "　　歼灭孙权刘备联军的最后力量，统一天下。"
  },
